  "description": "✅ Contents: at home you will receive a pack of glass cleaner, 500 ml glass and crystal degreaser from Mafra. ✅ Gentle degreasing action: the product acts deeply on glass and crystals, removing streaks, grease stains, fingerprints, traces of smog, smoke and any other kind of stain. The degreaser is ammonia-free and does not risk damaging or fading the plastic parts of the car with which it comes into contact ✅ IMPROVES VISIBILITY TO DRIVING: Its formula easily removes difficult dirt such as nicotine and traces of grease. Dries quickly, streak free eliminating streaks from night light glare on windows. ✅ HOW TO USE AND TIPS: Spray a little of the product on the area to be treated and make regular movements with a microfibre cloth or paper cloth, until completely absorbed. It is advisable to clean the car in a shaded area, as the direct and intense heat could dry the product too quickly, thus promoting the formation of unsightly streaks ✅ Italian Quality Experience: For over 50 years, Mafra has been committed to the production of high quality car care solutions. With a strong commitment to innovation and sustainability, each product is the result of advanced research and an authentic passion for the excellence of Made in Italy.",
